      "writtenOn": "2025-10-14T21:23:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case, would you be open to lowering the `BATTERY_STATE_OF_CHARGE_LOWER_THRESHOLD`? The current implementation aims to maintain the battery SoC within a specific range. Given that slow charging is a temporary solution, setting a lower threshold, such as 75%, could be a good starting point. This would avoid the need to modify the implementation once the full solution is enabled.\n\nWhat are your thoughts on this?",
